1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (heated food)
   )
   ```

2. Move the heated food to the desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on food livingroom_desk)
   )
   ```

3. Move the water bottle to the desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on water_bottle livingroom_desk)
   )
   ```